<title>POLAND: Stalexport signs $8 mln export deal.</title>
<headline>Stalexport signs $8 mln export deal.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA signed an $8 million contract on selling steel products to the United States, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Stalexport did not give the names of the firms involved but said the products would be delivered in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
